      en: ["The park includes a total of 17 intermittent lakes.", "Lake Palško is the largest, covering approximately 190 hectares.", "The lakes are formed by the rise of the karst groundwater table.", "Over 214 butterfly species have been recorded in this area.", "The Ecomuseum in Pivka explains the formation of the lakes.", "The area is a member of the European Natura 2000 network."],
